  "family_quality_rules": [
    "Every giant-territory page needs a large scale cue, but the cue must rotate across pages.",
    "Oversized architecture and props use broad simple shapes; giant scale does not justify clutter.",
    "Built and natural giant spaces should feel physically huge while the monster remains the focal subject.",
    "Use debris as a few massive objects rather than many small fragments."
